#problem("Finite subgroups of a field's units")[
  Prove that every finite subgroup of the multiplicative group of a field is cyclic. (Count elements of each order and compare with $sum_(d | n) phi(d) = n$.)

  #meta[★★][counting elements by order; $sum_(d | n) phi(d) = n$][Fall 2000 A3, Fall 2008 G2]
